之，字修齡，弱冠有聲譽，歷郡守、侍中、丹陽尹。素有風眩疾，發動甚數，而神明不損。石季龍死，朝廷欲綏輯河洛，以胡之為西中郎將、司州刺史、假節，以疾固辭，未行而卒。子茂之亦有美譽，官至晉陵太守。子敬弘，義熙末為尚書。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p004:m0056"}],"interpretation_note":"僅記本段明示死者，未有確年不補；石季龍死是朝廷擬授胡之的背景，不把胡之之死強定同一年，也不倒推生年。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p004:m0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"石季龍","kind":"person","person_id":"u61_ylg_6av","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p004","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p004","text":"子頤之嗣，仕至東海內史。頤之弟胡之，字修齡，弱冠有聲譽，歷郡守、侍中、丹陽尹。素有風眩疾，發動甚數，而神明不損。石季龍死，朝廷欲綏輯河洛，以胡之為西中郎將、司州刺史、假節，以疾固辭，未行而卒。子茂之亦有美譽，官至晉陵太守。子敬弘，義熙末為尚書。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p004:m0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"頤之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p004:m0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"頤之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p004:m0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"胡之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p004:m0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"修齡","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p004:m0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"石季龍","kind":"person","person_id":"u61_ylg_6av","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p004:m0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"胡之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDAB